  "changes": [
    "A source-local empty raw-stream writer accepts only b-empty for closed native/android NN stdout/stderr names. It uses the already held private output directory, O_EXCL/O_NOFOLLOW/O_CLOEXEC, 0400, regular/single-link/zero-size/current-directory-owner checks, file fsync and directory fsync, then the existing exact SHA/byte readback. Every nonempty artifact still uses frozen core.write_new unchanged.",
