    "Both native and Android actual child rows are appended before writing raw stream receipts. A write failure keeps joined/exit/errors/stream hashes and records structured artifact_error; it still fails the entire observation.",
    "The existing Android unjoined poison call is in finally around stream persistence so an I/O failure cannot skip that original obligation. The underlying runner, held transport, cleanup algorithm and all runtime/scope guards are unchanged.",
